   dslotunimpl, PRIVILEGE dslotpriv, OVERFLOW dslotovf" -> one row each.  "BOUNDS and ERROR x {delay slot}, and every trap
   instruction in a slot, are disclosed" -> no row, with the measured escape named (M_DSNOT_BOUNDS, M_DSNOT_ERROR).

